'''Bearkini''' (ビキニグマ, ''Bikini Guma'', '''Bikini Bear''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 2.5 Update|Version 2.5]].

