==Enemy==
A variant of [[Teacher Bear]], with both faster movement and faster attack rate, less range and attack power, along with higher health. It only has three knockbacks before death unlike Teacher Bear's ten knockbacks, and is more of a pusher type enemy rather than a backliner. Essentially a ranged [[Shy Boy]] without a trait.

==Strategy==
Anything that can outrange it like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] should be able to kill it, when at a low enough magnification. When buffed, you will need a strong attacker like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]].

